WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.033
The Q-P1NG APK in Downloads, as after downloading it from the website.

2
00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:07.633
Tap the file: Android prepares the package.

3
00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:13.167
Installing outside Google Play: Android asks you to allow this source once.

4
00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:19.200
Turn on Allow from this source, then go back.

5
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.267
Confirm Install.

6
00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:28.267
Installation in progress (time shortened).

7
00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:32.300
App installed: open it.

8
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.300
First start.

9
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.100
Private chats, useful tools and ways to connect offline.

10
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:41.900
Encrypted messages and calls over Tor, with identities you can verify.

11
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.733
Nearby contacts without internet. LoRa and VHF need compatible hardware.

12
00:00:45.733 --> 00:00:49.700
Notes and files in the encrypted vault; face protection before sharing images.

13
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:53.500
Download AI models when you need them; local AI then works offline.

14
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:58.333
Q-Feed: share with contacts or in public, and check the audience before sending.
